# ── Concerto: the app IS the website ────────────────────────────────
# Netlify serves real files first, so the 346 static venue pages and 76
# tour pages under /venues/* and /tours/* are unaffected by everything
# below -- their SEO is untouched.

# Legacy
# events.tsx retired -- /near-me is the single Near Me screen. A 301
# carries the old URL's ranking history across.
/events       /near-me   301
/events.html  /near-me   301
/mobile-bags.html   /mobile-bagcheck.html   301
/mobile-bags        /mobile-bagcheck        301

# Concerto+ is a FEATURE (the night planner); the paid tier is Premium.
/concertoplus       /premium   301
/concertoplus.html  /premium   301

# The APP's detail screens live at the SINGULAR paths, so they never
# collide with the plural static SEO pages:
#   /venue/madison-square-garden   -> app screen
#   /venues/madison-square-garden  -> static SEO page (indexed)
/venue/*   /venue/[slug].html   200
/tour/*    /tour/[slug].html    200

# Retired surfaces -- files deleted so these actually fire. Passport
# (formerly Live Mode) is retired entirely; /features carries the story.
/passport               /features          301
/passport.html          /features          301
/livemode               /features          301
/livemode.html          /features          301
/shop                   /premium           301
/shop.html              /premium           301
/mobile-livemode        /mobile-account    301
/mobile-livemode.html   /mobile-account.html   301

# Real 404 for anything else.
/*   /+not-found.html   404
